OL,3,GNEWSAWonder Woman filming site to
OL,4,Abecome housing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Grade II* listed building which was
OL,7,Fused as a filming location for Wonder
OL,8,FWoman 1984 is to be transformed into a
OL,9,F#200m housing and leisure development.
OL,11,FPlans have been approved to convert
OL,12,FLegal and General House in Kingswood
OL,13,Finto 299 homes, including 122
OL,14,Flater-living units, alongside leisure
OL,15,Ffacilities, office space and two
OL,16,Fswimming pools.
OL,18,FThe project will refurbish the
OL,19,Fbuilding, which was previously the
OL,20,Fheadquarters of L&G, and redevelop its
OL,21,F19-hectare green belt site.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
